    // operations, which is what <Provisioning/> (components/nx/Provisioning.tsx)
    // animates through. With nothing real to wait for, this whole function
    // used to return in one DB write — so fast that a human watching it never
    // saw more than a flash of the spinner before the "server is live" screen,
