 * family that provisions correctly today this code never executes at all. Any
 * error probing the guest returns `ok: false` immediately, i.e. exactly the
 * behaviour that existed before — this can only ever turn a failure into a
 * success, never the reverse, and `GAME_INSTALL_MAX_WAIT_MS` bounds it absolutely.
 */
